OL,3,GNEWSAWomen report pension shortfalls to
OL,4,Adeputy
OL,5,
OL,6,FA politician is exploring claims from
OL,7,Fwomen who say they are receiving a
OL,8,Fsmaller pension than they had expected.
OL,10,FDeputy Lee Van Katwyk said the way
OL,11,Fwomen's pensions were calculated had
OL,12,Fbeen changed in 2003 and they had
OL,13,Fstopped being based on a husband's
OL,14,Fcontribution record.
OL,16,FHe said many of those speaking to him
OL,17,Fhad been in their 40s when the changes
OL,18,Fwere made and had only discovered a
OL,19,Fshortfall when they had reached the
OL,20,Fpension age.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
